"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Cumberland County record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 42% of normal on the middle, while May to June ran 176%. Every grid but 24512 had its driest year in 2001, and grid 24512 bottomed out in 1991 at 65%.</p>"}
